# Turkish 3rd-person possessive suffix -(s)I marks the season in the
# year-first construction ("2020 ilkbaharı" == "2020's spring"). "ilkbahar"
# and "bahar" end in a consonant with a back unrounded last vowel (a), so
# vowel harmony gives -ı: ilkbaharı, baharı.
# TDK, İyelik ekleri (possessive suffixes): https://sozluk.gov.tr
ilkbahar
ilkbaharı
bahar
baharı
